    {
      "id": 376290975,
      "tag_name": "1.7.1",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/tswistak/Battery-Monitor/releases/tag/1.7.1",
      "published_at": "2026-08-25T09:37:14Z",
      "draft": false,
      "prerelease": false,
      "body": "\n1.7.0 was the last feature-oriented release before version 2.0 (October/November). The next releases will be less frequent and will consist only of bug fixes and small improvements.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fixed battery time estimates becoming incorrect after charging or discharging with custom prediction targets enabled.\n- Reset potentially corrupted cached long-term discharge estimates after updating.\n\n",
      "assets": [
        {
          "name": "battery-monitor-1.7.1.apk",
          "state": "uploaded",
          "size": 4232105,
          "browser_download_url": "https://github.com/tswistak/Battery-Monitor/releases/download/1.7.1/battery-monitor-1.7.1.apk",
          "digest": "sha256:4195e80060bad3cc3a6c14605a03aa11d6f7e46ebd1d828bde076be20e0080e4"
        },
        {
