    {
      "id": 375903211,
      "tag_name": "1.7.0",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/tswistak/Battery-Monitor/releases/tag/1.7.0",
      "published_at": "2026-08-24T18:22:54Z",
      "draft": false,
      "prerelease": false,
      "body": "\nThis is the last feature-oriented release before version 2.0 (October/November). The next releases will be less frequent and will consist only of bug fixes and small improvements.  \n\n### New\n\n- Possibility to set charging and discharging targets for time estimations (#72).\n- Automated detection of charging limits on supported devices.\n- Alarms for charging and discharging limits (#144).\n\n### Improved\n\n- Reorganized settings.\n- Show day count for time higher than 24 hours (#71).\n\n### Development\n\n- Release PGP signing.\n\n",
      "assets": [
        {
          "name": "battery-monitor-1.7.0.apk",
          "state": "uploaded",
          "size": 4231945,
          "browser_download_url": "https://github.com/tswistak/Battery-Monitor/releases/download/1.7.0/battery-monitor-1.7.0.apk",
          "digest": "sha256:db0c3dfee5fd7c1de9470735787f155777a1be501207e74b820d8f48cfcb8759"
        },
        {
