      "html_url": "https://github.com/tswistak/Battery-Monitor/releases/tag/1.3.2",
      "published_at": "2026-07-27T16:31:48Z",
      "draft": false,
      "prerelease": false,
      "body": "\n### Development\n\n- Refactored the whole app from Java to Kotlin (#7).\n- Refactored unit tests to JUnit and moved them to Gradle.\n\n",
