    {
      "id": 359436183,
      "tag_name": "1.3.1",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/tswistak/Battery-Monitor/releases/tag/1.3.1",
      "published_at": "2026-07-24T17:05:40Z",
      "draft": false,
      "prerelease": false,
      "body": "\n### Improved\n\n- Added timestamp to settings backup export file name.\n- More reliable way for running background service to better prevent aggressive optimization (#59).\n- Added manufacturer and model to log file name (#81).\n\n### Fixed\n\n- \"1 min until drained\" prediction while the plugged device stopped charging (#58). \n- Low-severity security issues.\n- Clearing \"Advanced\" tab contents on refresh (#57).\n\n### Development\n\n- Updated Gradle and dependencies to the latest versions.\n- Replaced deprecated APIs with current ones.\n- Refactored live updates to rely only on NotificationCompat.\n\n",
      "assets": [
        {
          "name": "battery-monitor-1.3.1.apk",
          "state": "uploaded",
          "size": 3624372,
          "browser_download_url": "https://github.com/tswistak/Battery-Monitor/releases/download/1.3.1/battery-monitor-1.3.1.apk",
          "digest": "sha256:cd36113ec26964d13e17b0c627f04a5c610a133e12ce3a9840580898e0160e58"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 356059434,
      "tag_name": "1.3.0",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/tswistak/Battery-Monitor/releases/tag/1.3.0",
      "published_at": "2026-07-18T08:48:15Z",
      "draft": false,
      "prerelease": false,
      "body": "\n### New\n\n- Added system (Android 13+) language chooser in settings (#56, thanks @Aga-C).\n- Added importing and exporting app settings (#51, thanks @Hirdaya-Shrestha).\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Using localized unit strings instead of hardcoded English ones (#63, thanks @Hirdaya-Shrestha).\n- Rewritten live updates to use NotificationCompat, to ensure it works well with API 36.\n- Turned off force refresh of battery data in OS in the Advanced tab, which could cause issues with some battery drivers.\n\n",
      "assets": [
        {
          "name": "battery-monitor-1.3.0.apk",
          "state": "uploaded",
          "size": 3620144,
          "browser_download_url": "https://github.com/tswistak/Battery-Monitor/releases/download/1.3.0/battery-monitor-1.3.0.apk",
